@startuml Chatly_Sequence_Handle_Friend_Request
title Chatly - Handle Friend Request (ECB)

autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Authenticated User" as User
boundary "Web/Mobile Client" as Client
control "ContactController\n/api/contacts/*" as ContactController
control "ContactService" as ContactService
entity "Contact" as ContactEntity
control "ContactRepository" as ContactRepo
control "GlobalExceptionHandler" as ExceptionHandler

User -> Client: Choose Accept / Reject / Block
Client -> ContactController: FriendActionRequest{contactId,\naction}
ContactController -> ContactService: handleRequest(contactId, action)

ContactService -> ContactRepo: findById(contactId)
ContactRepo --> ContactService: contact?

alt Contact not found or unauthorized
  ContactService -> ExceptionHandler: AppException(...)
  ExceptionHandler --> Client: HTTP 4xx\nApiResponse{error}
else Valid request
  ContactService -> ContactEntity: apply action\n(ACCEPT/REJECT/BLOCK)
  ContactEntity --> ContactService: updated contact
  ContactService -> ContactRepo: save or delete
  ContactRepo --> ContactService: updated
  ContactService --> ContactController: ContactResponse or message
  ContactController --> Client: HTTP 200\nApiResponse{code:1000, result/message}
end

Client --> User: Show updated status

@enduml